        ["Incluiste Cookies: se cerrarán las sesiones iniciadas en los sitios web."] = ("You included Cookies: logged-in sessions on websites will be closed.", "Você incluiu Cookies: as sessões iniciadas nos sites serão encerradas.", "Du hast Cookies einbezogen: Angemeldete Sitzungen auf Websites werden beendet.", "Vous avez inclus les Cookies : les sessions connectées sur les sites web seront fermées."),
